    <string name="terms_body">Use at your own risk. Jafnify is free, open-source software provided \"as is\", without warranty of any kind, as stated in the MIT License. The authors and contributors are not liable for any damage, data loss, security incident, service interruption, charges, or legal consequences that result from using it.\n\nYou are responsible for how you use it. Sharing a phone\'s connection may be limited or forbidden by your mobile plan\'s terms. Check them before use; any extra charges or account actions are your responsibility.\n\nWhat it protects. Jafnify encrypts the link between your computer and your phone.\n\nSecurity. Jafnify opens network ports on your devices while it runs. Only pair devices you own, on networks you trust. Keep both apps up to date. Report security problems privately as described in SECURITY.md.\n\nDo not use Jafnify for anything that is illegal where you are.</string>
